        },
        "text_gJmwkt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "\"Growing up in a household of artists, I have always had an appreciation for art. It's a visceral feeling when something moves you, and my sister's art has always had that effect on me. Long before my journey with Nodpod, I promised her I would find a way to share her art with the world, as she was unable to do so herself. With her gracious permission, she has allowed me to showcase her art alongside of her courageous journey through her mental health challenges. It is my honor to provide a platform for fellow artists to share their passion and create a sense of connection, compassion and visibility.\""
          }
